two-arch.txt and spill.txt are unedited ptxas -v output from nvcc 13.4.92
(pip wheel nvidia/cu13) compiling k.cu through a wrapper that takes the
address of launch_scale, so scale<128> is instantiated:

two-arch.txt: the spill kernel declared __launch_bounds__(256), with
  nvcc -std=c++20 -O3 -gencode=arch=compute_90a,code=sm_90a \
    -gencode=arch=compute_80,code=sm_80 -Xptxas -v -maxrregcount=64 -c

spill.txt: k.cu as checked in, __launch_bounds__(1024, 2), with
  nvcc -std=c++20 -O3 -arch=sm_90a -cubin -Xptxas -v
